# Imodane, the Pyrohammer: "an instant or sorcery spell ... that targets only a single creature" (CR 115.1, 601.2c). Fireball is a
# sorcery. Turn 3: X = 3 at Bot2's Ornithopter alone deals it 3 and Imodane deals Bot2 3 (20 -> 17). Turn 5: X = 2 at the second
# Ornithopter and at Bot2 deals each 1 (CR 120.3, divided evenly, rounded down) - the spell has a player among its targets, so Imodane
# does nothing: Bot2 goes only 17 -> 16, not 15.

